                <head>No. 130.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">La
                                Libertad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-17"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mosquito Indians have surrendered their rights under the treaty of 1860 and been
                    incorporated with Nicaragua.</p>
